    <p class="mb-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/85">Social Casino Index publishes clear, dated, source-linked records of operator terms: offers, games, redemptions, minimums and restrictions. Built for players and for AI engines — because operator pages are JavaScript-heavy and third-party info goes stale. Unknown terms stay marked as unknown.</p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
